  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons.\n• Slice brown onion and tomato into thin wedges.\n• Place veggies on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to combine.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68e730164f768e6eef37d30d/step-5adb0900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Boil kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with water, add a generous pinch of salt, then bring to the boil over high heat.\n• Cook penne in boiling water until 'al dente', 12 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P) then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68e730164f768e6eef37d30d/step-53835110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook garlic, tomato paste, and Nan’s special seasoning until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in the stock powder, cooking cream and reserved pasta water and cook until thickened, 1-2 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68e730164f768e6eef37d30d/step-1cf74720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir cooked penne, roast veggies and 1/2 the Parmesan cheese through sauce. Season to taste.\n• Divide rich tomato and roast veggie penne between bowls.\n• Top with remaining Parmesan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68e730164f768e6eef37d30d/step-0ecdad30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
